MOVING                          LOOKING                               
j/k  ↓/↑     select a row       b            feed, full screen        
g/G home/end first / last       h  ?         this keymap              
J/K          next / prev sheep  F            gather by fold           
ctrl-d/u     page the feed      z            collapse a fold          
←/→          environment tab    o            out / err / both         
←/→ alt-b/f  char / word move   m            minimum level            
ctrl-a/e     home/end in a box  f            follow the tail          
tab/S-tab    next / prev group  w            wrap long lines          
1-9          jump to a group    /            filter, or match         
n/N          next / prev match  r            refresh now              
↵            open selection     v            reveal for 10s           
esc          back one level     y            copy the value           
                                                                      
CHANGING                        DOING                                 
any char     types into a box   x            stop                     
⌫/del ↵ esc  erase, file, drop  R            restart                  
e            the config pane    L            reload                   
space        cycle a value                                            
d            restore default                                          
u            undo the edit                                            
s            shepherd settings                                        
S            secrets                                                  
D            delete a key                                             
c            leave it running                                         
ctrl-w/u/k   cut word, to ends                                        
                                                                      
                                                                      
 the three above each arm a confirm  ·  ↵ confirms  ·  10s to answer …
 colour is decoration only: every coloured cell says the same thing i…
 h or ?  closes this  ·  q  ctrl-c  quits lookout                     
                                                                      
                                                                      
                                                                      
                                                                      
